      "text": "not lift up sword … neither … learn war any more, Isa. 2:4 (2 Ne. 12:4). earth shall be full of the knowledge of the Lord, Isa. 11:9 (2 Ne. 21:9). they shall see the glory of the Lord, Isa. 35:2. I create new heavens and a new earth, Isa. 65:17 (2 Pet. 3:13; Rev. 21:1). I will set up one shepherd over them … my servant David, Ezek. 34:23. land that was desolate is become like the garden of Eden, Ezek. 36:35. was given him dominion, and glory, and a kingdom, Dan. 7:14. I will … make them to lie down safely, Hosea 2:18. Lord your God dwelling in Zion, Joel 3:17. beat their swords into plowshares, Micah 4:3. I will dwell in the midst of thee, Zech. 2:10.",
